  "implementation": [
    "One shared Linux credential ABI for serial and source execution; commit after validation, no cloning for queries; original get-ID worker fast path preserved.",
    "Original CredentialState shared by remote signal, scheduling, prlimit/capget, proc and family/waitid observers. No family graph rebuild on credential changes.",
    "Source mutation refreshes future direct/path/network/UTS/kernel-log/Unix sender/native/async consumers; accepted async work retains submission authority.",
    "Original mm Dumpable uses relaxed atomic state with credential publication ordering; fork/exec detach it. Sensitive commits clear parent-death signal.",
    "No coordinator/resource-service thread, polling bus, per-access permission lock or guest-memory barrier added."
  ],
